,"gloss":"couch"},{"surface":"சேர்த்தி","parts":[{"text":"சேர்த்து","lemma":"cērttu","gloss":"to lay"},{"text":"இ","lemma":"i","gloss":"having"}],"gloss":"having laid"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"ஞாங்கர்","parts":[{"text":"ஞாங்கர்","lemma":"ñāṅkar","gloss":"there"}],"gloss":"there"},{"surface":"மாய்ந்தனள்","parts":[{"text":"மாய்ந்தனள்","lemma":"மாய்ந்தனள்","gloss":"she died"}],"gloss":"she died","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"மடந்தை","parts":[{"text":"மடந்தை","lemma":"maṭantai","gloss":"young wife"}],"gloss":"young wife"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"இன்னும்","parts":[{"text":"இன்னு","lemma":"iṉṉu","gloss":"still"},{"text":"உம்","lemma":"um","gloss":"even"}],"gloss":"even still"},{"surface":"வாழ்வல்","parts":[{"text":"வாழ்","lemma":"vāḻ","gloss":"to live"},{"text":"வல்","lemma":"val","gloss":"I"}],"gloss":"I live"},{"surface":"என்","parts":[{"text":"என்","lemma":"eṉ","gloss":"what"}],"gloss":"what"},{"surface":"இதன்","parts":[{"text":"இது","lemma":"itu","gloss":"this"},{"text":"அன்","lemma":"aṉ","gloss":"of"}],"gloss":"of this"},{"surface":"பண்பே","parts":[{"text":"பண்பு","lemma":"paṇpu","gloss":"nature"},{"text":"ஏ","lemma":"ē","gloss":"indeed"}],"gloss":"nature indeed"}]}],"literal":"How great although, the measure of grief is what? / Since it does not have the strength to destroy life, / In the saline wasteland where spurge cactus has grown, / On the funeral pyre of mature firewood kindled in the open space, / Having laid her on the bed of bright fire, / There she passed away, my young wife; / Still I live, what is the nature of this?","translation":"However great it may be, what is the measure of this grief? Since it does not have the strength to take away my life. In the saline wasteland overgrown with spurge cactus, on the funeral pyre of mature firewood kindled in the open space, having laid her on that bed of bright fire, my young wife passed away there. Yet, I still live; what is the nature of this life of mine?","modern":"துன்பம் எவ்வளவு பெரியதாக இருந்தாலும், என் உயிரைப் போக்கும் வலிமை அதற்கு இல்லாததால், இந்தத் துயரத்தின் அளவு என்னவோ? கள்ளிச் செடிகள் வளர்ந்துள்ள களர்நிலப் பறந்தலையில், வெட்டவெளியில் மூட்டப்பட்ட விறகு ஈமத்தின் எரியும் நெருப்பைப் படுக்கையாகக் கொண்டு, என் மனைவி அங்கே மறைந்து போனாள். அவளை இழந்த பின்பும் நான் இன்னும் உயிரோடு வாழ்கிறேன்; இந்த என் உயிரின் தன்மைதான் என்னே!","explanation":"This poem is a moving lament (kaiyaṟunilai) by the Chera king Makkothai on the death of his queen. He expresses his deep grief, wondering why his immense sorrow has not killed him, showing that his grief lacks the strength to end his life. He describes his young wife being laid on the funeral pyre of mature firewood kindled in the desolate, cactus-filled wasteland. While she has departed into the bright flames, he is shocked and ashamed that he continues to live. The stark imagery of the burning pyre in the barren landscape intensifies the tragic feeling of loss and the king's self-reproach.","model":"gemini-3.5-flash"},"timing":{"male":[[0.1,0.5],[0.5,0.9],[0.9,1.1],[1.1,1.7],[1.86,2.14],[2.2,3.1],[3.1,3.25],[3.25,3.96],[3.96,4.67],[4.67,5.1],[5.1,5.62],[5.62,6.06],[6.06,6.5],[6.5,7.21],[7.21,7.68],[7.68,8.26],[8.26,8.38],[8.38,9.56],[9.56,10.5],[10.5,10.7],[10.7,11.19],[11.19,11.67],[11.67,12.4],[12.4,12.8],[12.8,13.7],[13.7,14.1],[14.17,14.5],[14.5,14.8]],"female":[[0.1,0.5],[0.5,1.0],[1.0,1.2],[1.2,1.9],[2.01,2.3],[2.3,3.02],[3.02,3.46],[3.46,4.4],[4.4,5.0],[5.0,5.9],[5.9,6.2],[6.2,6.5],[6.5,7.3],[7.3,8.11],[8.11,8.75],[8.75,9.56],[9.56,10.2],[10.2,11.1],[11.1,11.5],[11.5,11.7],[11.7,11.9],[11.9,13.1],[13.1,13.6],[13.6,14.1],[14.1,15.1],[15.1,15.5],[15.5,16.0],[16.0,16.3]]},"sync":[[["யங்கு","how"]],[["பெரிது","great"]],[["ஆயினும்","although"]],[["நோய்","grief"],["அளவு","measure"]],[["எனைத்தே","how much indeed"]],[["உயிர்","life"],["செகுக்கல்லா","not able to destroy"]],[["செகுக்கல்லா","not able to destroy"]],[["மதுகைத்து","possessing strength"]],[["அன்மையின்","because of not being so"]],[["கள்ளி","spurge cactus"]],[["போகிய","having grown"]],[["களரியம்","saline wasteland"]],[["பறந்தலை","cremation ground"]],[["வெள்ளிடை","open space"]],[["பொத்திய","kindled"]],[["விளைவிறகு","mature firewood"]],[["ஈமத்து","of the funeral pyre"]],[["ஒள்ளழல்","bright fire"]],[["பள்ளி","bed"]],[["பாயல்","couch"]],[["சேர்த்தி","having laid"]],[["ஞாங்கர்","there"]],[["மாய்ந்தனள்","she died"]],[["மடந்தை","young wife"]],[["இன்னும்","even still"]],[["வாழ்வல்","I live"]],[["என்","what"],["இதன்","of this"]],[["பண்பே","nature indeed"]]]}